WEBVTT

00:14:28.153 --> 00:14:30.620
onoliko subjektivan znanstvenoj analizi

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.580
koliko god i drugi fenomen u biologiji,

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.734
ili, dapače, u znanosti općenito.

00:14:34.734 --> 00:14:36.116
Puno vam hvala.

00:14:36.116 --> 00:14:41.609
(Pljesak)